{"GrafanaRuleListItem no longer has a `key` prop, which can cause React to reuse DOM nodes incorrectly when the list changes (e.g., paging/filters), leading to wrong row contents/actions": 0.40890035033226013, "RuleActionsButtons can be rendered with only `promRule` when `rule` is optional, but the Silence drawer never opens because it only renders when `rulerRuleType.grafana.alertingRule(rule)` is true and `rule` is `undefined`. Need to either require `rule` when Silence is enabled, hide the Silence action when `rule` is missing, or add a prom-rule-based drawer path": 0.9016706347465515, "The rule link no longer includes a `returnTo` parameter, so navigating to a rule and back to the list will lose the user's place. Need to wire `createReturnTo()` again in GrafanaRuleListItem.tsx": 0.9424864053726196, "The new Grafana-prom abilities gate `ModifyExport`, `Pause`, and `Restore` on `isAlertingRule`, making these actions unavailable for Grafana recording rules, whereas the previous `useAllRulerRuleAbilities` allowed them for any Grafana-managed rule": 0.43003934621810913, "The delete menu item is gated by `rulerRule` but the new list view only passes `promRule`, so delete will never appear for Grafana-managed rules in the list even though `canDelete` can be true via `useGrafanaPromRuleAbilities`": 0.3919003903865814}